-- statement:
--   Nine explicit signed coordinate permutation generators, 512 composition words, 246 representative normal and level pairs, explicit reordered baseline identifier lists for checking generator invariance, and a complete table of witnesses for all 19680 nonzero-normal/level pairs, including scalar rescaling by one or two. Every generated coordinate permutation has a checked explicit inverse, and all coordinate signs have square one. Coverage is recorded as data; its validity is proved separately. The redundant description by all 19680 nonzero normals avoids relying on an implicit normalization convention.
